 $$ |A \stackrel{G}{-} B| \leq \max(|A|, |B|, |A \stackrel{G}{+} B|, |A \stackrel{G}{+} 2B|)^{C_{3c}}$$
 whenever $A, B$ are finite subsets of reals and $G \subset A \times B$, where
-$$ A \stackrel{G}{\pm} rB := \{ a \pm rb: a \in A, b \in B\}.$$
+$$ A \stackrel{G}{\pm} rB := \{ a \pm rb: (a,b) \in G\}.$$
 
 
